2. Character art and sounds
=============================================================================

The character artwork, animation frames, layers and sounds (the contents of
Assets/res.dat, yunyun/res.dat, assets_src/ and the program icons) depict
YunYun from the game "YunYun Syndrome" and are NOT covered by the license
above. All rights to them belong to their respective owners, the developers
of "YunYun Syndrome". They are included with the developer's permission for
non-commercial use only.

You may use and redistribute them as part of this project for non-commercial
purposes. Any commercial use of these resources requires permission from
their owners.
